---
# Native AU tests compare explicit protocol and signal expectations, like the project's other tests.
# Core Foundation factory lookup and variable-length AudioBufferList/CocoaUI structures require ABI reinterpret casts.
# Keep that exception in this isolated native test host, never in the processing implementation.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-reinterpret-cast
